This is a placeholder for the PlanetGrowthData ScriptableObject instance.
Please create it in the Unity Editor:
1. Right-click in the `Assets/Settings/` folder in the Project panel.
2. Select `Create > ChaosCosmos > Planet Growth Data`.
3. Name the created asset `DefaultPlanetGrowth`.
4. Ensure the `massToRadiusCurve` values are set as per `PlanetGrowthData.cs` defaults if not automatically populated:
   - Keyframe(0, 0.5f)
   - Keyframe(1, 1f)
   - Keyframe(10, 3f)
   - Keyframe(40, 5f)
